[[Category:British screenwriters|Winterson, Jeanette]]
[[Category:British short story writers|Winterson, Jeanette]]
[[Category:Former students of St Catherine's College, Oxford|Winterson, Jeanette]]

[[es:Jeanette Winterson]]
