*{{cite book | author=[[Gary Kasparov|Kasparov, Garry]], and [[Raymond Keene]] | title=Batsford Chess Openings 2 | year=1989, 1994 | publisher=Henry Holt | id=ISBN 0-8050-3409-9}}
*{{cite book | author=Hooper, David and [[Kenneth Whyld]] | title=The Oxford Companion To Chess | publisher=Oxford University | year=1996 | id=ISBN 0-19-280049-3}}
