      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Thomas Ernest Bennett &quot;Tibby&quot; Clarke''' ([[June 7]], [[1907]] - [[February 11]], [[1989]]) was a [[film|movie]] scriptwriter who wrote several of the [[Ealing Studios]] comedies. His scripts always feature careful logical development from a slightly absurd premise to a farcical conclusion.

===Ealing comedies by T.E.B. Clarke===

*''[[Hue and Cry (movie)|Hue and Cry]]''
*''[[Passport to Pimlico]]''
*''[[The Lavender Hill Mob]]''
*''[[The Titfield Thunderbolt]]''

