        <ip>86.132.104.74</ip>
      </contributor>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''The 3AM Girls''' are the gossip columnists for the British tabloid ''[[The Daily Mirror]]''. They are currently made up of [[Kiki King]], [[Eva Simpson]] and [[Caroline Hedley]]. Former 3AM Girls include [[Jessica Callan]], [[Suzanne Kerins]], [[Dominique Hines]], [[Nikki Waldegrave]] and [[Polly Graham]].

In [[2003]], despite this being against the policy of the show, they were voted 31st worst Britons in the [[Channel 4]] poll [[100 Worst Britons]].

Not to be confused with [[3:AM Magazine]], a [[webzine]] founded in [[2000]].

== External links ==
* [http://www.mirror.co.uk/3am/ The 3AM Girls' column]
* [http://observer.guardian.co.uk/life/story/0,6903,639821,00.html Observer article on the 3AM Girls]

[[Category:Columnists|3AM Girls]]</text>
