      <comment>/* The ASU System */ linked dates</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">{{Infobox_University|
image=[[Image:Astate_logo.jpg|ASU seal]]&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;copy; Arkansas State University|
name=&lt;font color=&quot;red&quot;&gt;Arkansas State University&lt;/font&gt;|
