      <text xml:space="preserve">Definitions of '''Midi''':

* [[Le Midi]] is a colloquial name for [[Southern France]].

'''MIDI''' is an acronym which can refer to:

* The [[Musical_Instrument_Digital_Interface|Musical Instrument Digital Interface]] and its file format
* The [[Mid-IR Interferometric instrument]] for the [[VLT|VLTI]]
