|align=&quot;center&quot; | [http://www.getty.edu/research/conducting_research/digitized_collections/lissitzky/5_theories/images/Liss039L.jpg Letter]
|-
|align=&quot;center&quot; | 1925
|Letter to Sophie Küppers regarding the ''Reklamrelief'' (Pelikan relief)
|align=&quot;center&quot; | [http://www.getty.edu/research/conducting_research/digitized_collections/lissitzky/7_marketing/images/Liss056AL.jpg Letter]
|-
|align=&quot;center&quot; | 1935
| Letter to Sophie Küppers regarding stay in Switzerland
|align=&quot;center&quot; | [http://www.getty.edu/research/conducting_research/digitized_collections/lissitzky/12_ussr/images/Liss128L.jpg Letter]
|-
|colspan=&quot;4&quot; style=&quot;background:#fffdead;&quot;|&lt;small&gt;'''''Source''''': ''Works by El Lissitzky (2001). [http://www.ibiblio.org/eldritch/el/elc.html] Retrieved March 20, 2005.  ''&amp;mdash; '''''Source''''': ''Monuments of the Future: Designs by El Lissitzky (2002)[http://www.getty.edu/research/conducting_research/digitized_collections/lissitzky/index2.html] Retrieved March 20, 2005 '' &amp;mdash; '''''Source''''': ''El Lissitzky (2002)[http://mayakovsky.com/maya/pict3-liss.htm] Retrieved March 28, 2005'' &lt;/small&gt;
|}
&lt;center&gt;''See [[:Category:Artwork by El Lissitzky]] for other media''&lt;/center&gt;

Large amounts of his work are on permanent display in galleries worldwide. Much of his collection of Proun works can be viewed in the [[Van Abbemuseum]] in the [[Netherlands]], with other abstract  works on display in [[Sprengel Museum]] in Hannover. His work is also part of the [[Peggy Guggenheim Collection]] in [[Venice]].

