*[http://nesdev.parodius.com/bbs/viewtopic.php?t=601&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;start=15&amp;sid=f5104a63329f9f5ea04e8d44de4a58b1 Discussion of Adding A/V to a NES 2 fixing the block columns not handled by the previous mod.]

{{Nintendo hardware|NES}}
