        <id>711150</id>
      </contributor>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''OL''' may be an abbreviation for either of the following:
*'''[[Office lady]]''', a low-tier female office worker in [[Japan]]
*'''[[Olympique Lyonnais]]''', a prominent [[Ligue 1|French]] [[football (soccer)|football]] club
*'''[[Optics Letters]]''' is the journal published by [[OSA]]
*'''[[Offensive Lineman]]''' is a position on the offensive line of scrimmage in American football
'''OL''' is a [[Unified Soil Classification System|USCS]] symbol for [[organic material|organic]] [[silt]] and/or [[clay]]
{{2LCdisambig}}
[[ja:OL (曖昧さ回避)]]</text>
    </revision>
