* [http://www.dongguk.edu/english/college/cul_seon.htm Dongguk University major in Seon studies curriculum]
*[http://www.acmuller.net/ddb/ Digital Dictionary of Buddhism]
* [http://users.libero.it/seza/indexgb.html The Flower of Bodhidharma] Deepening Soen



{{buddhism2}}

[[Category:Korean Buddhism]] [[Category:Zen|*]]</text>
