      <comment>stub sorting -&gt; {{Champagne-geo-stub}}</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Magenta''' is a town and [[commune in France|commune]] in the [[Marne]] ''[[département]]'' of [[France]].  As of March 1999, it had a population of 1,920 people.  It shares its name with the better-known town of [[Magenta, Italy|Magenta]], [[Italy]].

==See also==
* [[Communes of the Marne département]].

==External links==
* [http://www.cideo.fr/magenta/ Ville de Magenta]

[[Category:Communes of Marne]]
{{Champagne-geo-stub}}

[[fr:Magenta (Marne)]]</text>
