      <text xml:space="preserve">The '''Minaret of Freedom Institute''' is an [[Islamic]] [[libertarian]] [[organization]], based in [[Bethesda, Maryland]]. Its president is [[Imad-ad-Dean Ahmad]].

The institute's mission is twofold: to educate [[Muslims]] about the properness of a [[liberty|liberal]] [[free-market]] [[society]], and to teach non-Muslims about Muslim belief and its ''clash'' with [[Western culture]].

